hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"211","[AI-translation] Haddasna Ibn Abi Umar, qala: Haddasna Sufyan, 'an Yazid bin Yazid bin Jabir, 'an 'Abd al-Rahman bin Abi 'Amra, 'an jaddatihi Kabsha, qalat: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef laye to ek latakii hui qirba se khade hokar piya, to main uske muh ki taraf gayi aur usey kaat diya."
"212","[AI-translation] Haddasna Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: Haddasna 'Abd al-Rahman bin Mahdi, qala: Haddasna 'Uzra bin Thabit al-Ansari, 'an Thumama bin 'Abdullah, qala: Anas bin Malik bartan mein teen marta saans lete the, aur Anas ne bataya ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) bartan mein teen marta saans lete the."
"213","[AI-translation] Haddasna 'Abdullah bin 'Abd al-Rahman, qala: Haddasna Abu 'Asim, 'an Ibn Jurayj, 'an 'Abd al-Karim, 'an al-Bara' bin Zayd ibn ibnat Anas bin Malik, 'an Anas bin Malik, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Umm Sulaim ke paas tashreef laye, aur ek qirba latak rahi thi, to unhon ne qirba ke muh se khade hokar piya, to Umm Sulaim qirba ke muh ki taraf khadi hui aur usey kaat diya."
"214","[AI-translation] Haddasna Ahmad bin Nasr al-Naysaburi, qala: Haddasna Ishaq bin Muhammad al-Farwi, qala: Haddasatna 'Ubaida bint Na'il, 'an 'Aisha bint Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas, 'an abiha, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) khade hokar piya karte the. Abu 'Isa ne farmaya: aur baaz logon ne kaha: 'Ubaida bint Nabil."
"215","[AI-translation] Haddasna Muhammad bin Rafi' wahidan, qalu: Haddasna Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri, qala: Haddasna Shayban, 'an 'Abdullah bin al-Mukhtar, 'an Musa bin Anas bin Malik, 'an abihi, qala: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki ek sukka hoti thi jis se wo khushboo lagate the."
"216","[AI-translation] Haddasna Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: Haddasna 'Abd al-Rahman bin Mahdi, qala: Haddasna 'Uzra bin Thabit, 'an Thumama bin 'Abdullah, qala: Anas bin Malik khushboo ko radd nahi karte the, aur Anas ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) khushboo ko radd nahi karte the."
